#: extension/prefs.js:218
msgid "HD Microphone"
msgstr "Micro HD"

#: extension/prefs.js:219
msgid ""
"Experimental. Adds a high-quality microphone input, named after your AirPods "
"with “(HD)”, that keeps playback in high quality while recording. Choose it "
"in the Sound settings."
msgstr ""
"Expérimental. Ajoute une entrée micro de haute qualité, au nom de vos "
"AirPods suivi de « (HD) », qui garde la lecture en haute qualité pendant "
"l’enregistrement. Choisissez-la dans les paramètres Son."

#: extension/prefs.js:230
msgid "Automatic Connection"
msgstr "Connexion automatique"

#: extension/prefs.js:231
msgid ""
"Connect when you put your AirPods in or start playing, unless another device "
"is using them"
msgstr ""
"Se connecter quand vous mettez vos AirPods ou lancez une lecture, sauf si un "
"autre appareil les utilise"

#: extension/prefs.js:236
msgid "Switch With Your Apple Devices"
msgstr "Bascule avec vos appareils Apple"

#: extension/prefs.js:237
msgid ""
"Experimental. The AirPods move between this computer and your iPhone, iPad "
"or Mac on their own, as between Apple devices. This computer then presents "
"itself as an Apple device to Apple accessories. The AirPods reconnect "
"briefly when this is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Expérimental. Les AirPods passent d'eux-mêmes de cet ordinateur à votre "
"iPhone, iPad ou Mac, comme entre appareils Apple. Cet ordinateur se présente "
"alors comme un appareil Apple aux accessoires Apple. Les AirPods se "
"reconnectent brièvement quand vous l'activez."

